---
// Redrawn illustrations of four platform screens. Every name, number and sentence here is invented.
interface Props {
  screen: 'myday' | 'brief' | 'territory' | 'roleplay';
}
const { screen } = Astro.props;

const TITLES = {
  myday: 'The morning home page',
  brief: 'An account brief, after the judge',
  territory: 'The territory sandbox',
  roleplay: 'A role-play scorecard',
};

// Territory illustration: a seeded field of account dots, each assigned to the nearest of eight region seeds.
const rand = (() => {
  let s = 7;
  return () => ((s = (s * 16807) % 2147483647) - 1) / 2147483646;
})();
const seeds = Array.from({ length: 8 }, (_, i) => ({
  x: 70 + (i % 4) * 150 + rand() * 60,
  y: 70 + Math.floor(i / 4) * 150 + rand() * 60,
}));
const dots = Array.from({ length: 640 }, () => {
  const c = seeds[Math.floor(rand() * seeds.length)];
  const x = c.x + (rand() + rand() + rand() - 1.5) * 190;
  const y = c.y + (rand() + rand() + rand() - 1.5) * 150;
  let best = 0;
  seeds.forEach((s, i) => {
    if ((s.x - x) ** 2 + (s.y - y) ** 2 < (seeds[best].x - x) ** 2 + (seeds[best].y - y) ** 2) best = i;
  });
  return { x, y, r: 1.6 + rand() * 2.6, region: best };
}).filter((d) => d.x > 12 && d.x < 628 && d.y > 12 && d.y < 328);
const counts = seeds.map((_, i) => dots.filter((d) => d.region === i).length);
const maxCount = Math.max(...counts);

const RUBRIC = [
  { name: 'Acknowledge', score: 4 },
  { name: 'Reframe', score: 3 },
  { name: 'Evidence', score: 5 },
  { name: 'Stay on frame', score: 4 },
  { name: 'Close the loop', score: 2 },
];
---

<figure class="screen">
  <div class="frame" role="img" aria-label={`Illustration of ${TITLES[screen].toLowerCase()}, drawn with invented data`}>
    {
      screen === 'myday' && (
        <div class="myday" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="greet">
            <strong>Good morning, Dana.</strong> Two replies came in overnight, and <u>Northwind Supply</u> moved to
            proposal on Friday. Your 10:30 with <u>Harbor & Vine</u> has no agenda yet.
          </div>
          <div class="cols">
            <div>
              <h4>Today's queue</h4>
              <ul class="queue">
                <li><span class="tag meet">Meeting</span> Harbor & Vine, discovery <em>10:30</em></li>
                <li><span class="tag due">Overdue</span> Follow up with Juniper Goods <em>3 days</em></li>
                <li><span class="tag out">Outreach</span> Calder Systems: new operations lead <em>draft ready</em></li>
                <li><span class="tag out">Outreach</span> Pine Street Co.: visited pricing twice <em>draft ready</em></li>
                <li><span class="tag task">Task</span> Send security answers to Northwind <em>today</em></li>
                <li><span class="tag fc">Forecast</span> Alder Group close date is in the past <em>fix</em></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4>What changed</h4>
              <ul class="changed">
                <li><b>Replies</b> 2 overnight</li>
                <li><b>Pipeline</b> 3 deals moved in 48 hours</li>
                <li><b>Signals</b> 4 warm accounts</li>
              </ul>
              <h4>Time saved this month</h4>
              <p class="big">6.5 <small>hours, estimated</small></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      )
    }
    {
      screen === 'brief' && (
        <div class="brief" aria-hidden="true">
          <h4>Northwind Supply <small>brief, refreshed overnight</small></h4>
          <p>
            Their operations lead said the current tool "cannot plan past two weeks" <sup>C2</sup>. The pilot scope
            agreed on the last call covers one region <sup>C3</sup>.
            <s>They plan to expand to four regions by spring.</s> <span class="struck">struck: no source says this</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            Pricing went out on the 4th and was opened three times <sup>E1</sup>. Legal asked for the security
            questionnaire <sup>E2</sup>. <s>The buyer has budget approved.</s>
            <span class="struck">struck: the email says "pending"</span>
          </p>
          <ul class="sources">
            <li><sup>C2</sup> Call, 28 Oct, 14:02</li>
            <li><sup>C3</sup> Call, 6 Nov, 31:40</li>
            <li><sup>E1</sup> Email, 4 Nov</li>
            <li><sup>E2</sup> Email, 7 Nov</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      )
    }
    {
      screen === 'territory' && (
        <div class="territory" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 640 340">
            {dots.map((d) => (
              <circle cx={d.x} cy={d.y} r={d.r} class={`r${d.region}`} />
            ))}
          </svg>
          <ul class="balance">
            {counts.map((c, i) => (
              <li>
                <span class={`sw r${i}`} />
                Region {i + 1}
                <span class="meter">
                  <span style={`width:${(c / maxCount) * 100}%`} class={`r${i}`} />
                </span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      )
    }
    {
      screen === 'roleplay' && (
        <div class="roleplay" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="chat">
            <p class="them">We looked at something like this last year and it went nowhere. Why would now differ?</p>
            <p class="me">
              That is fair. What stalled it last year? If it was the rollout, I can show how two teams your size went
              live in a month.
            </p>
            <p class="them">Mostly rollout. Send me those two.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="score">
            <p class="total">18 <small>of 25</small></p>
            <ul>
              {RUBRIC.map((r) => (
                <li>
                  {r.name}
                  <span class="pips">
                    {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((n) => (
                      <i class:list={{ on: n <= r.score }} />
                    ))}
                  </span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p class="improve">To improve: you never asked for a next step.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      )
    }
  </div>
  <figcaption><strong>{TITLES[screen]}.</strong> An illustration I redrew for this page. All names and numbers are invented.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .screen {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .frame {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    background: var(--bg);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -28px oklch(0.3 0.1 258 / 0.45);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  figcaption strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  h4 {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  h4 small {
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* My Day */
  .greet {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    background: var(--cobalt-tint);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--cobalt-deep);
  }
  .cols {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr));
  }
  .cols > div:first-child {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cols > div:first-child {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
  .queue li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .queue em {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .tag {
    padding: 0.05rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--wash);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .tag.meet {
    background: var(--cobalt);
    color: var(--on-cobalt);
  }
  .tag.due {
    background: var(--signal);
    color: oklch(0.25 0.05 70);
  }
  .tag.out {
    background: var(--cobalt-tint);
    color: var(--cobalt-deep);
  }
  .changed li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .changed b {
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  .changed + h4 {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }
  .big {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .big small {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  /* Brief */
  .brief h4 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .brief h4 small {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .brief p {
    max-width: 64ch;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .brief p + p {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .brief sup {
    padding: 0 0.3em;
    margin-left: 0.15em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--cobalt-tint);
    color: var(--cobalt-deep);
    font-size: 0.7em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .brief s {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-decoration-color: oklch(0.55 0.2 25);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  }
  .struck {
    padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: oklch(0.95 0.03 25);
    color: oklch(0.42 0.16 25);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sources {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.4rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  /* Territory */
  .territory {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    align-items: center;
  }
  .territory svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    grid-column: span 2;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .territory svg {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
  .balance li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8rem 5rem 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .sw {
    width: 0.8rem;
    height: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .meter {
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--wash);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .meter span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .r0 { fill: oklch(0.47 0.19 258); background: oklch(0.47 0.19 258); }
  .r1 { fill: oklch(0.75 0.16 78); background: oklch(0.75 0.16 78); }
  .r2 { fill: oklch(0.58 0.19 25); background: oklch(0.58 0.19 25); }
  .r3 { fill: oklch(0.6 0.13 165); background: oklch(0.6 0.13 165); }
  .r4 { fill: oklch(0.55 0.18 310); background: oklch(0.55 0.18 310); }
  .r5 { fill: oklch(0.68 0.13 215); background: oklch(0.68 0.13 215); }
  .r6 { fill: oklch(0.45 0.08 110); background: oklch(0.45 0.08 110); }
  .r7 { fill: oklch(0.65 0.17 45); background: oklch(0.65 0.17 45); }
  circle {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Role-play */
  .roleplay {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    align-items: start;
  }
  .chat {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .chat p {
    max-width: 34ch;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .them {
    background: var(--wash);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 3px;
  }
  .me {
    justify-self: end;
    background: var(--cobalt);
    color: var(--on-cobalt);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 3px;
  }
  .total {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .total small {
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .score ul {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }
  .score li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pips {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .pips i {
    width: 0.8rem;
    height: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--wash);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .pips i.on {
    background: var(--cobalt);
    border-color: var(--cobalt);
  }
  .improve {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--signal-ink);
    font-weight: 550;
  }
</style>
